{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24602","headline":"香山居士写真诗 · 白居易","name":"香山居士写真诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔作少学士，图形入集贤。\n今爲老居士，写貌寄香山。\n鹤毳变玄发，鸡肤换朱颜。\n前形与後貌，相去三十年。\n勿叹韶华子，俄成皤叟仙。\n请看东海水，亦变作桑田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24602.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24602","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}